1製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211204/543866757422518272768143.jpeg/Ql8gIYtO5fi9x6ohsLTxdX6W-SY4pPU_cgXVu3IF1bs\"/><figcaption>日本人妻突收「女性聯署信」　才知10年枕邊人竟是超級極品渣男（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"示意圖（《其實並不在乎你》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211204/543866751495704576580379.jpeg/hUilGiswgm7I9hUuRgX_yr9HoiAE5jOvE-bOdRPmznU\"/><figcaption>示意圖（《其實並不在乎你》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本人妻突收「女性聯署信」　才知10年枕邊人竟是超級極品渣男（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211204/543866759251365888359148.jpeg/UdejJ0XaB2ZbI3SBoKEy_a7BOBbxDseG5_5s8Of-bPA\"/><figcaption>日本人妻突收「女性聯署信」　才知10年枕邊人竟是超級極品渣男（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本人妻突收「女性聯署信」　才知10年枕邊人竟是超級極品渣男（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211204/543866738953949184518093.jpeg/Qa1WAfv-HcCz1sfni_wjJXS2vYTOg0w9qaUZoKmlGaA\"/><figcaption>日本人妻突收「女性聯署信」　才知10年枕邊人竟是超級極品渣男（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>黃仁勳認外遇！正宮低調背景曝光 姊弟戀41年遇女高管桃色陷阱</p><p>極致體貼文化！日本消臭噴霧收服老外 官方統計：台人買最多</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T11:23:57.097154+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2009,"images":30,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T11:00:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T11:57:26.045393+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T11:17:26.022579+00:00","content_hash":"673a4aa3ac89c8e74b9443d44b3e7747e2bb3980a5064f1ce6fe16c03dc60115","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}